        "heading": "Research Question and Design",
        "body": "The study asks whether mindfulness training changes particular attentional operations instead of producing a vague global improvement. It operationalizes attention through the Attention Network Test, using cue and flanker conditions to index alerting, orienting, and conflict monitoring across MBSR, retreat, and control groups tested before and after training.",
