        "body": "After the 8-week MBSR course, participants showed stronger orienting response-time difference scores than both controls and retreat participants. The authors interpret this as an improvement in endogenous orienting, plausibly tied to repeated practice of engaging attention, moving it back to the breath or body, and sustaining a selected focus.",
