        "body": "The lack of Time 2 group differences in conflict monitoring is important because it blocks a simple all-purpose improvement story. The authors suggest that repeated exposure to the ANT may have improved conflict performance even in controls, making it harder to detect any extra training-related benefit and possibly creating floor effects in response time.",
