      {
        "heading": "Assumptions and Limits",
        "body": "The interpretation depends on mapping behavioral ANT components to dorsal and ventral attention systems and on distinguishing concentrative from receptive practice. Those mappings are plausible but indirect here because the study does not include neural measurements. Group differences in prior experience, training dose, age range, and motivation also constrain causal claims.",
