        "heading": "Practical Interpretation",
        "body": "For readers, the practical lesson is that mindfulness training should not be treated as one uniform cognitive intervention. Structured novice MBSR may be most relevant to deliberate orienting and selected focus, while intensive practice in experienced meditators may cultivate readiness to detect unanticipated events. The source is best read as an early, targeted behavioral demonstration rather than a final clinical prescription.",
